	 *	       : association is in, i.e. COOKIE-WAIT,
	 *	       : COOKIE-ECHOED, ESTABLISHED, SHUTDOWN-PENDING,
	 *	       : SHUTDOWN-SENT, SHUTDOWN-RECEIVED, SHUTDOWN-ACK-SENT.
	 *
	 *		Note: No "CLOSED" state is illustrated since if a
